{"ticker":"CRH","updated":"2026-10-23T22:48:57Z","profile":{"longName":"CRH plc","shortName":"CRH PLC","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","country":"Ireland","website":"https://www.crh.com","fullTimeEmployees":83032,"marketCap":56476000256,"trailingPE":14.998234,"forwardPE":13.374148,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.4618968,"pegRatio":1.65,"targetMeanPrice":122.71667,"targetHighPrice":160.0,"targetLowPrice":96.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.056,"earningsGrowth":0.139,"grossMargins":0.3625,"operatingMargins":0.19022,"profitMargins":0.099350005,"totalRevenue":38632001536,"beta":1.191,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":131.55,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":78.62,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.8},"summary":"CRH plc, together with its subsidiaries, provides building materials solutions in Ireland, the United States, the United Kingdom, rest of Europe, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Americas Materials Solutions, Americas Building Solutions, and International Solutions. The company offers building materials for the construction and maintenance of public infrastructure, and commercial and residential buildings, as well as construction and renovation of transportation infrastructure, critical utility networks, commercial and residential buildings, and outdoor living spaces; paving and construction services; and produces and sells aggregates, cementitious materials, ready mixed concrete and mortars, and asphalt. It also manufactures, supplies, and delivers building products for the built environment in communities in North America; and provides building and infrastructure solutions for complex critical utility infrastructure, such as water, energy, transportation, and telecommunications projects, and outdoor living solutions for private and public spaces. In addition, the company produces and supplies precast and pre-stressed concrete products comprising vaults, pipes, and manholes; and concrete and polymer-based products, such as underground vaults, drainage systems, enclosures, and modular precast structures for applications in transportation, water, energy, ","summary_zh":"CRH plc 及其子公司在愛爾蘭、美國、英國、歐洲其他地區和國際上提供建築材料解決方案。該公司透過三個部門運作：美洲材料解決方案部門、美洲建築解決方案部門和國際解決方案部門。該公司為公共基礎設施、商業和住宅建築的建設和維護，以及交通基礎設施、關鍵公用設施網路、商業和住宅建築以及戶外生活空間的建設和改造提供建築材料；鋪路和施工服務；生產和銷售骨料、膠凝材料、預拌混凝土和砂漿以及瀝青。它還為北美社區的建築環境製造、供應和交付建築產品；為複雜的關鍵公用基礎設施提供建築和基礎設施解決方案，例如水、能源、交通和電信項目，以及私人和公共空間的戶外生活解決方案。此外，該公司還生產和供應預製和預力混凝土產品，包括拱頂、管道和沙井；以及基於混凝土和聚合物的產品，例如用於交通、水、能源、","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"建築材料","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":113.3,"h":113.63,"l":112.54,"c":112.59,"v":3881900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":111.64,"h":114.4,"l":111.47,"c":114.27,"v":5092000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":113.76,"h":114.27,"l":113.24,"c":113.24,"v":4026200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":113.36,"h":113.7,"l":112.38,"c":113.19,"v":5214800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":113.22,"h":113.32,"l":111.67,"c":112.95,"v":3532100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":109.19,"h":111.45,"l":108.86,"c":111.28,"v":4067100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":111.67,"h":111.99,"l":110.42,"c":111.91,"v":2375800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":111.76,"h":112.08,"l":110.32,"c":111.61,"v":3427400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":112.14,"h":112.78,"l":110.7,"c":112.36,"v":3599700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":111.45,"h":113.06,"l":109.39,"c":112.06,"v":3899400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":112.32,"h":112.32,"l":110.54,"c":110.72,"v":2738400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":111.08,"h":111.76,"l":110.69,"c":111.26,"v":3674900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":112.14,"h":114.55,"l":111.64,"c":114.47,"v":4090900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":113.96,"h":114.83,"l":113.38,"c":113.39,"v":2974100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":113.79,"h":114.47,"l":112.95,"c":113.24,"v":2776800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":114.05,"h":114.05,"l":112.08,"c":112.53,"v":3132100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":112.74,"h":114.04,"l":110.68,"c":111.25,"v":2877300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":111.6,"h":112.9,"l":110.95,"c":112.46,"v":2649100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":113.13,"h":113.42,"l":112